widgets_values:
Analyze only the body pose in this image for another image model. Output one concise English block beginning exactly with "POSE TRANSFER:".

Use screen-relative directions and describe:
- torso lean and rotation in approximate degrees;
- shoulder line and hip line angle;
- head direction;
- screen-left arm and screen-right arm: upper-arm direction like a clock hand, elbow bend angle, forearm direction, and hand position relative to the head and torso;
- screen-left leg and screen-right leg: thigh direction, knee bend angle, shin direction, and foot position;
- whether the body is airborne and the overall silhouette;
- which limbs are closer to the camera.

Describe geometry only. Ignore and never mention identity, face, helmet, hair, costume, colors, accessories, objects, background, lighting, and style. Output only the POSE TRANSFER block.

